  "notes": [
    "**Diversificar** is a regular **-AR verb** with a spelling change",
    "Spelling change: c→qu before é (diversifiqué, not \"diversificé\") - same pattern as explicar, sacar",
    "This spelling change only affects the \"yo\" form in preterite",
    "Past participle: **diversificado** (regular)",
    "Common in business/finance contexts",
    "Common usage: *diversificar inversiones* (to diversify investments), *diversificar la cartera* (to diversify the portfolio)",
